Create a web page titled "Event Sign-Up".
Add a text input "Name".
Add a dropdown "Meal" with options: fish, veggie, chicken.
Add a button "Sign up".
When the button is clicked, append a new row to signups.csv with columns: name, meal.
Fill the name column from "Name" and the meal column from "Meal".
Show "Thanks, you're signed up!" after the row is added.
